# Integration test databases (mandatory)

## Prefer H2 in PostgreSQL mode

Database integration / repository ITs use **H2 with `MODE=PostgreSQL`** (see `H2PostgresModeSupport`), not a containerized database.

- Fast, hermetic, no Docker daemon required for `./gradlew qualityCheck`
- Keep production runtime on real **Postgres** (Compose / `jdbc.driver=org.postgresql.Driver`)

## Do not use Testcontainers

- **Do not** add Testcontainers (or similar container-based test DB runners) for this project’s automated tests.
- **Do not** reintroduce Testcontainers “because Rancher/Docker works locally” — CI and agent sandboxes vary; H2 PG-mode is the standard.
- Runtime verification of app + Postgres remains **`docker compose`**, separate from unit/IT quality gates.
